<%# locals: (meeting:) %>
<%# Hours chip in the meeting header meta row — same component and spot as the
    ticket header. The wrapper span always renders (the component itself skips
    rendering at 0 booked minutes) so create.turbo_stream.erb has a stable
    replace target for the FIRST booking as well. %>
<span id="<%= "#{dom_id(meeting)}_time_summary" %>" class="inline-flex">
  <%= render SubjectTimeSummaryComponent.new(subject: meeting, user: current_user) %>
</span>
